===Verb===
{{head|en|verb|head=[[rustle]] [[up]]}}

# {{context|idiomatic|lang=en}} To [[forage]] for, or (figuratively) to [[quickly]] [[prepare]], something.
#: ''I'll see if I can '''rustle up''' a meal before the guests start arriving in 30 minutes.''

====Usage notes====
There is no "rustle down".

